sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Code / thub CLI
    participant TH as Training Hub Library
    participant Reg as AlgorithmRegistry
    participant CB as TrainingHubCallback
    participant Backend as Backend Implementation
    participant Sub as Subprocess<br/>(torchrun / mp.spawn / Popen)
    participant GPU as GPU<br/>(CUDA/NCCL)
    participant LLMAPI as LLM API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Disk as Local Filesystem

    Note over User,Disk: Flow 1: SFT / OSFT Training

    User->>TH: sft() / osft() or thub sft --config config.yaml
    TH->>Reg: resolve algorithm + backend
    Reg-->>TH: SFTAlgorithm + InstructLabTrainingSFTBackend
    TH->>Backend: execute_training(params)
    Backend->>HF: Download model/dataset (optional)<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>Backend: Model weights + dataset
    Backend->>Sub: Launch torchrun (multi-GPU/multi-node)
    Sub->>GPU: Training loop (NCCL for multi-GPU)
    Sub->>CB: on_train_begin, on_step_end, on_log...
    CB-->>Sub: Callback hooks executed
    GPU-->>Sub: Training complete
    Sub->>Disk: Save checkpoints
    Sub-->>Backend: Training results
    Backend-->>TH: TrainingResult
    TH-->>User: Return results

    Note over User,Disk: Flow 2: LoRA + GRPO (ART Backend)

    User->>TH: lora_grpo()
    TH->>Reg: resolve algorithm + backend
    Reg-->>TH: LoRAGRPOAlgorithm + ARTLoRAGRPOBackend
    TH->>Backend: execute_training(params)
    Backend->>Disk: Create seed LoRA checkpoint<br/>(zero-effect lora_B weights)
    Backend->>Sub: mp.spawn subprocess<br/>(isolate from vLLM threads)
    Sub->>GPU: vLLM inference + Unsloth LoRA training<br/>(time-shared single GPU)
    Sub->>Disk: Write training_results.json<br/>+ training_metrics.jsonl
    Sub->>Sub: os._exit(0)<br/>(avoid vLLM V1 shutdown hang)
    Backend->>Disk: Read training_results.json
    Backend-->>TH: TrainingResult
    TH-->>User: Return results

    Note over User,Disk: Flow 3: LoRA + GRPO (verl Backend)

    User->>TH: lora_grpo(backend="verl")
    TH->>Backend: execute_training(params)
    Backend->>Disk: Prepare data (Parquet format)
    Backend->>Sub: Popen verl.trainer.main_ppo<br/>(Hydra CLI overrides)
    Sub->>GPU: FSDP distributed training<br/>+ vLLM rollout generation
    loop Real-time metrics
        Sub-->>Backend: Parse stdout for metrics
    end
    Sub->>Disk: Save checkpoint<br/>(normalized adapter config + merged tokenizer)
    Sub-->>Backend: Training complete
    Backend-->>TH: TrainingResult

    Note over User,Disk: Flow 4: GEPA Prompt Optimization (No GPU)

    User->>TH: gepa()
    TH->>Backend: execute_training(params)
    Backend->>LLMAPI: Task evaluation via litellm<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer OPENAI_API_KEY
    LLMAPI-->>Backend: Evaluation results
    Backend->>LLMAPI: Reflection / mutation<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer OPENAI_API_KEY
    LLMAPI-->>Backend: Mutated prompts
    Note over Backend: Evolutionary search loop<br/>(no GPU required)
    Backend-->>TH: Best candidate prompt
    TH-->>User: Optimized prompt

    Note over User,Disk: Flow 5: Embedding SFT

    User->>TH: embedding_sft()
    TH->>Backend: execute_training(params)
    Backend->>GPU: SentenceTransformerTrainer<br/>(triplet/MNRL contrastive loss)
    GPU-->>Backend: Training complete
    Backend->>Disk: Save fine-tuned embedding model
    Backend-->>TH: TrainingResult
    TH-->>User: Return results
